      "text": "By virtue of and pursuant to the authority vested in me by section 5 of the act\nof February 8, 1887 (ch. 119, 24 Stat. 388-389), it is ordered that the periods of trust\non allotments made to Indians of the Yakima Reservation, Washington, which,\nunless extended, would expire during the calendar year 1935, be, and they are hereby,\nextended for a further period of 10 years from the date on which any such trust would\n\notherwise expire."
    }
